陽，降之。儀因言秦復與魏，而使公子繇質於魏。儀因說魏王曰：「秦王之遇魏甚厚，魏不可以無禮。」魏因入上郡、少梁，謝秦惠王。惠王乃以張儀為相，更名少梁曰夏陽。"}],"rationale":"依前10段明示姓名與局部敘事暫接；張儀短名不取普通詞，楚相失璧與後文檄告暫接，未名妻與蘇秦舍人不補姓名。秦惠王王稱不取王業、欲王或王隨之。周天子、魏王與趙王不按年代記憶補名；桀紂為引古，鬼谷傳承未確證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p010","text":"秦惠王十年，使公子華與張儀圍蒲陽，降之。儀因言秦復與魏，而使公子繇質於魏。儀因說魏王曰：「秦王之遇魏甚厚，魏不可以無禮。」魏因入上郡、少梁，謝秦惠王。惠王乃以張儀為相，更名少梁曰夏陽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"x9j_eu1_vck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"公子華","kind":"person","person_id":"gp4_92s_txh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"公子繇","kind":"person","person_id":"e8s_gf1_o9r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"3bl_wnq_da6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"x9j_eu1_vck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"x9j_eu1_vck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"x9j_eu1_vck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m010-00